                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "76529b2e-ec09-3e50-b583-df097a870131",
                        "entry_id": "63667fac-8f7d-3e81-8291-75f1b0b2c706",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to or consisting of faggots of wood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                        "entry_id": "63667fac-8f7d-3e81-8291-75f1b0b2c706",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characteristic of or appropriate for homosexual men, especially effeminate ones."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "offensive",
                            "slang",
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "96f969f8-256f-4010-bfdb-ebf62426fe28",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "And there is two things in Harlem I don't understan' / It is a bulldyking woman and a faggoty man"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88350709-89ca-4ba6-97cb-161ca3f0515a",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "american critic ad 1935 / alias faggoty slob with a sob […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a8350ba-67ca-42c8-834c-328f44fef933",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "Our whole literature has become faggoty and Commie and epicene and androgynous. I say it stinks and the hell with it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb9574a7-d90a-498b-9f62-72ff303d6cb6",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "My lieutenant was my bitterest opponent. \"A queer's a queer,\" he insisted. \"Christ, they’re no damn good, any of ’em. You know that. Why waste sympathy on the faggoty sonuvvabitch?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79d5a825-f5ce-4273-b9db-518652d00cc0",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "How come all you college boys wear them faggoty-looking white shoes?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cfa7da2-7f26-4dfa-89f7-5ff8635930a4",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "[Letter No.] 3. I see the enemy of all drag queens.... the genuine gay, as those maze-yentas, the up-tight professional, epigoni-homosexual, and their loot-organisations who make a point in all the media to say that they are not swish, faggoty mad screaming, drag queens.... but just mutual cock-suckers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ed3aada-9fed-47b2-8d89-a1b30a17804e",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "Also good are Johnny Lee Davenport's Strength, Lou Ferguson's God, adolescent Jay Kiecolt-Wahl's Five Wits, and Kyle Hall's Beauty; unfortunately, Alan Wilder's sleazy Goods, Marilyn Dodds Frank's country-hick Kindred, and David Alan Novak's faggoty Cousin rely on cheap-shot stereotypes (does he really have to flip a limp wrist when he says \"thither\"?)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acd98848-4998-45ef-b085-fabb2f67abd7",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "Lacrosse is not a sport; lacrosse is a faggoty college activity. I don't care how rough it is, anytime you're running around a field, waving a stick with a little net on the end of it, you're engaged in a faggoty college activity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3a5a6ff-f1f1-40aa-add9-58339d9a889d",
                                "sense_id": "2fdd9ef8-f7b2-302b-a6a7-5167ea8e79e6",
                                "text": "--is a big, fat, fucking, faggoty yes, NL. You're definitely one or the other."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
